                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَازِنٌ</span></b> 
                        : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَاجِحٌ</span>: <i>heavy:</i> (Msb:) or <i>of full
weight:</i> (KL:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وُزَّنٌ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَالٌّ</span>. You say,
